id=bcm_bt_fix
name=Samsung BCM4375 Bluetooth Fix
version=v3.3
versionCode=6
author=Antigravity
description=Fixes Bluetooth audio drops, Watch/Buds disconnections, and pairing crashes on Galaxy S20 Ultra by neutralizing HCI timeout suicide & Error 225 reporter, disabling buggy BCM4375 LE Extended Advertising (enforcing stable Legacy Advertising), skipping unsupported LE_ENERGY_INFO, disabling Qualcomm/Samsung DSP A2DP offload, and disabling sniff collisions.
